  "name": "ALL_FEATURES_TEST",
  "description": "Single portfolio exercising every correctly-implemented SL/Target feature, retargeted to the only data in the catalog: NIFTY_FUTURES_MS (venue) / NIFTY_FUTURES (1-MINUTE LAST, 2020..2025) and NIFTY_SPOT (1-SECOND LAST, 2026). All active slots use the 1-minute NIFTY futures instrument with Format-B (LAST/ohlcv) pricing. SLOTS: S1 %SL/%TP + SL-wait + close | S2 absolute-via-flag SL (15 pts, Premium abs/% fix) + reverse-on-SL | S3 ATR-SL/ATR-TP + re_execute | S4 Leg Trailing Target (%) | S5 %SL/%TP | S6 points-SL/points-TP + re_entry | S7 NIFTY-SPOT 1s->5m aggregation %SL/%TP. PORTFOLIO: Combined-Loss SL (delay+selective-loss-legs+trailing) | Combined-Profit Target (delay+selective-profit-legs+trailing) | Move-SL-to-Cost 'All Legs Despite Loss / Profit' (+trail-after) | VWAP+directional fills ON | squareoff 20:00 UTC | entry window 01:00-18:00 | no_reexec/no_reentry_sl_cost. NOTE: S7 (NIFTY-SPOT) is DISABLED by default because its only data is a disjoint 2026 window; the other 6 slots run cleanly in the 2024 window. To test NIFTY-spot/aggregation: enable S7 and set the portfolio start_date/end_date to 2026-03-03..2026-03-21 (and ideally disable the 2024-only slots), so the curve is single-window.",
